// Bitcoin Lab's world (bitcoin-lab-walk.coax): the Grid's floor and sky, the lesson's lit panels,
// lamps and glyphs. build.sh writes apps/openagents-web/bitcoin-lab-fx.wgsl from this with
// coax/web/wgsl-module.coax (bitcoin-lab-fx.module and bitcoin-lab-fx.bindings beside it). The
// shader is the engine's quad world (aethyr/fx/gpu-quads.coax): the host draws it after
// Character Create's scene (your figure), depth-tested against it.
#load "../../../aethyr/fx/gpu-quads.coax";
